---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const articleLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "BirkyStudio vs Allo: An AI Receptionist You Rent by the Seat vs a Front Desk That Answers",
  "description": "Honest 2026 comparison of BirkyStudio vs Allo for real estate agents. Allo is the cheapest unlimited AI call answering in the category, a flat $32 a seat plus $32 for the AI receptionist, with numbers, porting and SMS included and no contracts. But it is a phone system you operate by the seat, it never holds a WhatsApp conversation, its AI does not place outbound calls and it is English-first. BirkyStudio answers your phone and WhatsApp 24/7 in English and Spanish, follows up automatically and sells once instead of monthly. Real pricing, real limits, no bias.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Luna Jerney",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Birky Studio",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://birkystudio.com/images/birky-logo.jpg"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-11-24",
  "dateModified": "2026-11-24"
});

const faqLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does Allo cost?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Allo publishes its prices, which already puts it ahead of most vendors in this category. A Business seat is $32 a month billed yearly, or $45 month to month, and the AI Receptionist is an add-on that costs one more seat per agent, $32 a month billed yearly or $45 month to month. So one agent with the receptionist pays the equivalent of about $64 a month billed yearly, or about $90 a month on monthly billing, which is $768 and $1,080 for the year. There is no per minute meter, so a busy week costs the same as a quiet one. An extra phone number starts at $5 a month, the Power Dialer is a flat $50 a month for the whole team, and a HIPAA Business Associate Agreement is $50 a month for the whole workspace. There are no setup fees and no contracts, seat changes are prorated, and every plan starts with a 3 day free trial with the AI add-on enabled."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Allo answer WhatsApp messages?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Allo is a phone system and its AI receptionist answers inbound calls, sends an SMS text back to a missed call and updates your CRM after every call, but it does not hold an AI conversation on WhatsApp. For a lot of real estate buyers, especially in Latin America, the United States and Europe, WhatsApp is where the first message actually arrives, and a chat that waits until someone picks it up is a lead that waits. BirkyStudio's Text Receptionist is $297 one time and holds full WhatsApp conversations 24/7 in English and Spanish, so it answers the channel Allo does not cover."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Allo's AI make outbound calls?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No, and Allo is unusually honest about it. Its own comparison page states that today the AI receptionist answers calls and does not place them, so outbound calling stays with the people on your team, helped by the $50 a month Power Dialer and the Ultra plan's AI SDR. BirkyStudio is not a dialer either, and we are not going to pretend otherwise. What we do place is the follow-up: The Base Agent reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, saves it and answers it instantly, then follows up automatically without you approving each send, in English and Spanish. The $1,997 Lead Generation Pack pairs that with a verified prospect list and outreach, which is about who to contact rather than how fast the phone dials."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How is Allo different from BirkyStudio's AI Receptionist?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "They both answer the phone around the clock, which is why this page pairs them. The difference is the shape of the purchase and the width of the answer. Allo is a phone system you operate, sold per seat, on subscription every month, where the AI receptionist is an add-on and stopping the payment stops the number. BirkyStudio builds it for you once: the Voice Receptionist is $550 one time plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month, and it answers calls 24/7 in English and Spanish, not English first. Add the $297 WhatsApp Text Receptionist and the $1,297 Base Agent and one operator covers phone, WhatsApp and website enquiries into a Notion CRM included free. Allo wins on being a complete phone system with porting, SMS and an IVR at the lowest unlimited price in the category. We win on covering the inbox as well as the phone line, in two languages, for a one time price."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Allo have a contract, a setup fee or a free trial?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "This is a place where Allo is genuinely clean and worth saying plainly. There are no setup fees and no contracts, you can upgrade, downgrade or cancel whenever you want, changes to seats are prorated so you never pay for seats you do not use, and every plan starts with a 3 day free trial with the AI add-on enabled for the length of the trial, though a card is required. That is a fairer buying experience than Sierra Interactive's twelve month agreement or CINC's quoted pricing. BirkyStudio is also contract free, with no minimum term and a 30 day money back guarantee on the build."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Allo include a website or lead generation?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No to both. Allo is a business phone system, so it supplies none of its own leads and it does not build a website. What it does is answer and log the calls you already get, sync them to the CRM you already pay for through HubSpot, Pipedrive, Attio, Salesforce or Zapier, and text back the ones you miss. If you want leads to call, BirkyStudio's Verified Prospect List at $497 or $997 one time is a file of verified, enriched, scored prospects you own, not a rented stream, and our websites at $499, $999 and $1,999 one time are yours with the code in your hands. If you need an IDX listing site, that comes from a platform such as BoldTrail, Sierra Interactive or Placester."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What do Allo's own reviewers say?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Mostly good, with two honest gaps. G2 shows roughly 4.6 to 4.7 out of 5 across about 200 reviews, and the things reviewers praise are the flat unlimited price, the mobile first design, the CRM sync and the AI receptionist itself. G2's own summary of the downsides lists a lack of picture messaging, SMS features reviewers miss, some call quality and app lag, and a desktop app that several users call weaker than the mobile app. One reviewer wrote that it was a shame SMS messages are no longer unlimited, and another described terrible call quality with no update for over a month. Trustpilot is thinner: 4.2 out of 5 across 24 reviews, positive on call clarity and support, with a few 1 star reviews about being charged after cancelling. None of that changes the value case, but it is the same lesson as always: use the free trial rather than trusting a page like this one, including ours."
      }
    }
  ]
});
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BirkyStudio vs Allo (2026 Comparison)"
  description="Honest 2026 comparison: Allo is the cheapest unlimited AI call answering, but it never holds a WhatsApp conversation. BirkyStudio answers calls and WhatsApp 24/7 EN and ES."
  image="/images/comparison/allo.jpg"
  >
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={articleLD} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={faqLD} />

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section style="padding:100px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;position:relative;z-index:1;">
      <div style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:100px;color:white;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:20px;">
        Updated November 2026 • Honest comparison
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.15;">
        BirkyStudio vs Allo<br>
        <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-accent),var(--bs-accent));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">An AI Receptionist You Rent by the Seat vs a Front Desk That Answers</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;max-width:700px;">
        Allo is the most honest price in the AI receptionist market right now. One Business seat is $32 a month billed yearly and the AI receptionist is one more seat at $32, so a solo agent pays about $64 a month, all in, with unlimited minutes and no per minute meter, on top of a real phone system with numbers in 80 or more countries, free porting, SMS, call recording and the IVR. There is no setup fee, no contract and a 3 day free trial. If all you need is a call answered, that is hard to beat and we say so on this page. The limit is what it does not do: Allo never holds a WhatsApp conversation, its own page states the AI answers calls and does not place them, it is English first, and it is a phone line you rent by the seat forever. BirkyStudio is the other half of the front desk. Here is the honest breakdown, including every place Allo is the better buy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section style="padding:80px 0">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">

      <!-- Quick Answer -->
      <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-bg-raised),var(--bs-bg-raised));border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:64px;border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.3);">
        <h2 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">⚡ Quick Answer</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose Allo if:</strong> You want the cheapest unlimited AI call answering in the category, you want a full phone system rather than just an answering add-on, and you want to see every price before you speak to anyone. A seat plus the receptionist is about $64 a month billed yearly, the minutes are unlimited, the number is yours to port, SMS and call recording are in, and it syncs to the CRM you already pay for. It is genuinely good value, ships in minutes, and you can leave whenever you like.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose BirkyStudio if:</strong> The problem is wider than the phone line. A buyer writes on WhatsApp on a Sunday and hears nothing until Tuesday. Half your clients would rather speak Spanish. You want the calls, the WhatsApp chats and the website enquiries all answered and followed up in seconds, around the clock, in both languages, and you would rather pay $297 to $1,297 once than $64 a month forever.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">The honest difference:</strong> Allo is the cheapest way to stop missing phone calls, and it wins that fight. BirkyStudio covers the channels a phone system cannot reach, the message apps and the inbox, and it is cheaper after the first year because you buy it once. If the only thing going unanswered is the phone, Allo is the better buy. If leads arrive by message and by call and nobody is awake for either, that is the job we built for.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 1 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/allo-article-1.jpg" alt="Wide view of a bright modern real estate office reception area with a front desk, guest seating, plants and tall windows in warm daylight" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Why Compare -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:16px;">Why compare BirkyStudio and Allo?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        Most pages on this site weigh a platform against a front desk. This one is the closest to a true head to head, because Allo and BirkyStudio both sell an AI that answers the phone. Allo is a business phone system built for small teams, mobile first, with the AI receptionist as an add-on, and it is the one product in this category that publishes a flat, unlimited price with no per minute meter. Its own roundups put it first for solo agents and small real estate teams, and on price that ranking is fair: a seat plus the receptionist is about $64 a month, which is cheaper than Smith.ai, Goodcall, RingCentral, Nextiva and CloudTalk on the lines we have compared on this site.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        BirkyStudio takes a different route. The Voice Receptionist is $550 one time plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month, and it answers calls 24/7 in English and Spanish. Add the WhatsApp Text Receptionist at $297 one time and the AI also holds real conversations on the channel a lot of buyers actually use. Add The Base Agent at $1,297 one time, with a Notion CRM for agents included free, and every website and WhatsApp enquiry is read, sorted, saved, answered and followed up automatically. Add a Verified Prospect List at $497 or $997 one time and you start from real, enriched, scored prospects you own rather than calls you have to wait for.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:40px;">
        So the real question is not which product is well built. Both are, and Allo is the cheaper one on the phone line. The question is how wide your front desk needs to be: one line answered well, or every channel answered in two languages by something you own. That is what the tables below compare, and we have written down the parts where Allo wins, because there are several.
      </p>

      <!-- Comparison Table -->
      <h2 id="comparison" style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">BirkyStudio vs Allo, Side by Side</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--bs-accent);">
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">Feature</th>
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">BirkyStudio</th>
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">Allo</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Starting Price</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">$0 15-minute audit, projects from $297 one-time</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ $32 per seat per month billed yearly, 3-day free trial</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">What It Is</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">A done-for-you AI operator we build and run for you</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">A business phone system you subscribe to and operate per seat</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Price Visible Before a Sales Call</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, every price is published on our site</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Yes, seats and every add-on are published</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Pricing Model</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ One-time build you own, optional $97/mo or $197/mo care</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Monthly subscription per seat, forever</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Free Trial</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Free 15-minute audit, 30-day money-back guarantee</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ 3-day free trial, AI add-on enabled, card required</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Setup Fee</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ None</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ None</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Contract Commitment</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ No contract, no minimum term, 30-day money-back on the build</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ No contract, cancel anytime, seat changes prorated</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Answers Your Phone with AI</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Voice Receptionist $550 one-time (Vapi ~$30-50/mo), 24/7 EN and ES</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ AI Receptionist $32 per agent per month on top of a seat, 24/7, unlimited minutes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Per-Minute Meter</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ None, you pay Vapi usage only</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ None, unlimited AI minutes on the flat add-on</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Extra Cost Per Person</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ None, the build is not priced per seat</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Every agent needs a seat, and the receptionist adds one more</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">AI Makes Outbound Calls</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Follow-up and WhatsApp replies are automatic, outbound dialing is not the core</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ No, Allo says its AI answers calls and does not place them</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">AI Conversations on WhatsApp</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Text Receptionist $297 one-time, full AI conversations 24/7</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ No WhatsApp agent, SMS text-back only</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Bilingual (EN / ES)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included, receptionist and website both</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ English first, a French voice is advertised, no Spanish claim</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Full Phone System (numbers, porting, SMS, IVR)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ We answer the line, you keep your carrier and number</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Numbers in 80+ countries, free porting, SMS, IVR, call recording</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Call Recording and Transcripts</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included with the receptionist</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Every call recorded, transcribed and summarised</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Books Appointments</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Into your calendar, in English and Spanish</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Google Calendar, Outlook, Cal.com or Calendly</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Missed-Call Text Back</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Reply and follow-up are automatic</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Sends the SMS follow-up automatically</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">CRM</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Notion CRM for agents included free with The Base Agent</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Syncs to HubSpot, Pipedrive, Attio, Salesforce or Zapier, your CRM</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Team Plans and Seats</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Business tier from $2,997 one-time, not priced per seat</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Built for teams, unlimited seats, each billed per seat</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Lead Generation</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Verified, enriched, scored prospect list you own ($497 / $997 one-time)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ No leads supplied, it answers the calls you already get</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Website</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ $499 / $999 / $1,999 one-time, you own the code</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Not a website product</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">HIPAA and Compliance Add-on</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Not offered</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ HIPAA BAA $50 per month for the whole workspace</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">SMS Sending</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ WhatsApp messages included, no per-message meter</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ US sending included, $5 credit per seat then pay as you go, $24 A2P once</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Setup Time</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Live in 2 to 3 days, we build it for you</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ A number in about 10 minutes, receptionist configured in about 15</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
