            → <strong style="color:white;">BirkyStudio</strong>. This is the clearest difference between the two products. Allo answers calls, texts back a missed call and keeps a shared SMS inbox, but it holds no WhatsApp conversation at any plan. A buyer who opens WhatsApp on a Sunday evening still gets silence. The Text Receptionist is $297 one time and answers that channel in seconds, in English and Spanish, 24/7. If your first contact happens in a chat app, that is the product the phone system cannot replace.
